-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Collier</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Goldberg</surname><given-names>RB</given-names></name><name><surname>Prineas</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Skyler</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Schneiderman</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cigarette smoking, alcohol use, and physical activity in relation to serum leptin levels in a multiethnic population: The Miami Community Health Study</article-title><source>Ann Epidemiol</source><year>1999</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>108</fpage><lpage>113</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10037554</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S1047-2797(98)00037-4</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chu</surname><given-names>NF</given-names></name><name><surname>Stampfer</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Spiegelman</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Rifai</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Hotsmisligil</surname><given-names>GS</given-names></name><name><surname>Rimm</surname><given-names>EB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Dietary and lifestyle factors in relation to plasma leptin concentrations among normal weight and overweight men</article-title><source>Int J Obes Relat Metab Disord</source><year>2001</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>106</fpage><lpage>114</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11244465</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/sj.ijo.0801468</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jensen</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name><name><surname>Koh-Banerjee</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Franz</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Sampson</su